          "match": "\\b(?:set|endset|for|endfor|if|elif|else|endif|macro|endmacro|call|endcall|filter|endfilter|include|import|from|as|extends|block|endblock|with|without|context|endwith|raw|endraw|do|in|is|not|and|or|recursive|ignore|missing|scoped|required|true|false|none|True|False|None)\\b",
          "name": "keyword.control.jinja.ipu-asm"
